25:
UJehova wathi kuye:
“Esiswini sakho kukhona izizwe ezimbili;
izinhlobo ezimbili zabantu ziyakwahlukana ezibilinini zakho;
esinye isizwe siyakwahlula esinye,
omkhulu akhonze omncane.”

27:
Abantu mabakukhonze,
izizwe zikukhothamele;
yiba yinkosi yabafowenu,
amadodana kanyoko akukhothamele;
makaqalekiswe okuqalekisayo,
abusiswe okubusisayo.”

35:
UNkulunkulu wathi kuye:
“NginguNkulunkulu uSomandla;
mawuzale, wande;
isizwe, yebo, ibandla lezizwe liyakuvela kuwe;
amakhosi ayakuphuma okhalweni lwakho;

48:
ingelosi engisindise ebubini bonke mayibusise abafana;
mababizwe ngegama lami nangegama lawobaba o-Abrahama no-Isaka;
mabande, babe baningi phakathi kwezwe.”

49:
Ungangeni emkhandlwini wabo,
mphefumulo wami;
ungahlangani nebandla labo,
nhliziyo yami,
ngokuba ngolaka lwabo babulala abantu;
ngobudlova babo basika izinkabi umsipha.

“Juda,
abafowenu bazakukudumisa wena;
isandla sakho siyakuba sesijingweni sezitha zakho;
amadodana kayihlo ayakukukhothamela.

“UZebuloni uyakwakha ngasogwini lolwandle,
abe sosebeni lwemikhumbi;
umkhawulo wakhe uzakuba ngaseSidoni.

“UJosefa uyingatsha entsha ethelayo,
ingatsha ethela ngasemthonjeni;
amagatsha akhe akhwela odongeni.

“UBenjamini uyimpisi ehomfuzayo;
ekuseni uyadla impango,
kusihlwa uyahlukanisa akuphangileyo.”

15:
UJehova ungamandla ami nehubo lami;
waba yinsindiso kimi;
unguNkulunkulu wami: ngizakumdumisa,
noNkulunkulu kababa: ngizakumphakamisa.

“Isandla sakho sokunene, Nkosi,
sidumisekile ngamandla aso;
esokunene sakho, Nkosi, siyaphahlaza isitha.

Waphephetha ngomoya wakho,
ulwandle lwabasibekela;
baminzisa okomthofu emanzini anamandla.

“Ngomusa wakho wabahola abantu obahlengileyo;
ngamandla akho wabayisa
endlini yakho engcwele.

Khona aphaphatheka amakhosi akwa-Edomi;
izikhulu zakwaMowabi zabanjwa yitwetwe;
bonke abakhe eKhanani baphelile amandla.

10:
Kwathi ekusukeni komphongolo uMose washo wathi:
“Vuka, Jehova;
mazihlakazeke izitha zakho;
abakuzondayo mababaleke ebusweni bakho.”

21:
Ngalokho abakhulu ngezaga basho bathi:
“Wozani eHeshiboni; makwakhiwe,
umuzi kaSihoni umiswe;

ngokuba umlilo uphumile eHeshiboni;
ilangabi livelile emzini kaSihoni;
liqedile i-Ari lakwaMowabi nabakhe emadulini ase-Arinoni.

“Sibacibishele;
iHeshiboni liphelile kuze kube seDiboni;
sichithile kuze kube seNofa elingaseMedeba.”

23:
Wayesethatha isisho sakhe, wathi:
“Vuka, Balaki, uzwe;
ngilalele, wena ndodana kaSipori:

Ayikho imilingo engamelana
noJakobe;
akukho ukubhula okungamelana no-Israyeli;
manje sekuyashiwo ngoJakobe nango-Israyeli
ukuthi uNkulunkulu wenzeni.

24:
“UNkulunkulu wamkhipha eGibithe;
unjengezimpondo zenyathi kubo;
uyakuqeda izizwe, izitha zakhe,
aphule amathambo azo,
azigwaze ngemicibisholo yakhe.

“Ngiyambona, kepha kungemanje;
ngiyambheka, kodwa kungeseduze;
kuyakuvela inkanyezi kuJakobe,
nentonga yobukhosi iyakuvuka kwa-Israyeli,
ishaye uMowabi emaceleni,
ichithe onke amadodana kaSheti.

Wayesewabuka amaKheni, wathatha isisho sakhe, wathi:
“Inamandla indawo yakho yokuhlala;
isidleke sakho simisiwe edwaleni.

26:
URubeni, izibulo lika-Israyeli: amadodana kaRubeni:
kwaHanoki: ngumndeni wakwaHanoki;
kwaPhalu: ngumndeni wakwaPhalu;

Amadodana kaSimeyoni ngemindeni yawo:
kwaNemuweli: ngumndeni wakwaNemuweli;
kwaJamini: ngumndeni wakwaJamini;
kwaJakini: ngumndeni wakwaJakini;

Amadodana kaGadi ngemindeni yawo:
kwaSefoni: ngumndeni wakwaSefoni;
kwaHagi: ngumndeni wakwaHagi;
kwaShuni: ngumndeni wakwaShuni;

Amadodana kaJuda ngemindeni yawo:
kwaShela: ngumndeni wakwaShela;
kwaPheresi: ngumndeni wakwaPheresi;
kwaZera: ngumndeni wakwaZera.

Amadodana kaPheresi:
kwaHesironi: ngumndeni wakwaHesironi;
kwaHamule: ngumndeni wakwaHamule.

Amadodana ka-Isakare ngemindeni yawo:
kwaThola: ngumndeni wakwaThola;
kwaPhuva ngumndeni wakwaPhuva;

Amadodana kaZebuloni ngemindeni yawo:
kwaSeredi: ngumndeni wakwaSeredi;
kwa-Eloni: ngumndeni wakwa-Eloni;
kwaJaleli: ngumndeni wakwaJaleli.

Amadodana kaManase:
kwaMakiri: ngumndeni wakwaMakiri; uMakiri wazala uGileyadi;
kwaGileyadi: ngumndeni wakwaGileyadi.

Lawa angamadodana kaGileyadi:
kwa-Iyezeri: ngumndeni wakwa-Iyezeri;
kwaHeleki: ngumndeni wakwaHeleki;

Lawa angamadodana ka-Efrayimi ngemindeni yawo:
kwaShuthela: ngumndeni wakwaShuthela;
kwaBekeri: ngumndeni wakwaBekeri;
kwaThahani: ngumndeni wakwaThahani.

Amadodana kaBenjamini ngemindeni yawo:
kwaBela: ngumndeni wakwaBela;
kwa-Ashibeli: ngumndeni wakwa-Ashibeli;
kwa-Ahiramu: ngumndeni wakwa-Ahiramu;

Amadodana kaBela ayengo-Arida noNahamani;
kwa-Arida: ngumndeni wakwa-Arida;
kwaNahamani: ngumndeni wakwaNahamani.

Amadodana ka-Asheri ngemindeni yawo:
kwaJimna: ngumndeni wakwaJimna;
kwaJishiwi: ngumndeni wakwaJishiwi;
kwaBeriya: ngumndeni wakwaBeriya.

Kumadodana kaBeriya:
kwaHebere: ngumndeni wakwaHebere;
kwaMalikiyeli: ngumndeni wakwaMalikiyeli.

Amadodana kaNafetali ngemindeni yawo:
kwaJaseli: ngumndeni wakwaJaseli;
kwaGuni: ngumndeni wakwaGuni;

Nampa ababalwayo babaLevi ngemindeni yawo:
kwaGereshoni: ngumndeni wakwaGereshoni;
kwaKohati: ngumndeni wakwaKohati;
kwaMerari: ngumndeni wakwaMerari.

32:
“Uyidwala, umsebenzi wakhe uphelele,
ngokuba zonke izindlela zakhe zingukulunga;
unguNkulunkulu wokuthembeka ongenakonakala;
ulungile, uqotho yena.

“Bonile kuye;
abasibo abantwana bakhe, kuyisici sabo;
bayisizukulwane esiphambeneyo nesiyisigwegwe.

“UJeshuruni wayesekhuluphala,
wakhaba;
usukhuluphele, uzimukile,
uchachambile;
wayesemshiya uNkulunkulu owamenza,
walidelela iDwala lensindiso yakhe.

Ngokuba umvini wabo
ungumvini waseSodoma
nowamasimu aseGomora;
izithelo zabo ziyizithelo zenyongo,
amahlukuzo abo amunyu;

“ ‘Bonani manje ukuthi mina,
yebo, mina nginguye,
akakho unkulunkulu ngaphandle kwami;
mina ngiyabulala, besengiphilisa,
ngilimazile, kepha ngiyakupholisa;
akakho ongophula esandleni sami.

33:
Izibulo lenkunzi yakhe liludumo lwakhe,
nezimpondo zenyathi ziyizimpondo zakhe;
uyakuqhubukusha ngazo izizwe zonke ekugcineni komhlaba;
zinjalo izigidi zakwa-Efrayimi,
zinjalo izinkulungwane zakwaManase.”

U-Israyeli usehlezi elondekile;
umthombo kaJakobe wahlukene wodwa
ezweni lamabele nelewayini;
yebo, amazulu akhe aconsisa amazolo.

5:
“Yizwani nina makhosi;
bekani indlebe nina zikhulu;
mina, yebo, mina ngiyakuhlabelela kuJehova,
ngihubele kuJehova uNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli.

Bakhetha onkulunkulu abasha;
lapho kwafika impi emasangweni;
kwabonwa isihlangu noma umkhonto yini
phakathi kwezinkulungwane ezingamashumi amane kwa-Israyeli na?

“Khona wayenza insali ukuba ibuse
abakhulu;
abantu bakaJehova bangibeka ukuba ngibuse iziqhwaga.

Izikhulu zakwa-Isakare zazinaye
uDebora;
njengo-Isakare, kanjalo noBaraki;
behlela ngokushesha esigodini ezinyathelweni zakhe.
Ngaseminonjaneni yakwaRubeni
kwakukhona ukululekana okukhulu kwenhliziyo.

Wakhothama ngasezinyaweni zakhe,
wawa, walala;
ngasezinyaweni zakhe wafola, wawa;
lapho wakhothama khona, wawela khona efile.

‘Angithi batholile babelana impango?
Intombi, yebo, izintombi ezimbili endodeni ngayinye;
kuSisera impango yezingubo ezinemibala,
impango yezingubo ezinemibala ezifekethisiweyo;
izingubo ezimbili ezinemibala ezifekethisiweyo zezintamo
zaba yimpango.’

2:
“Akakho ongcwele njengoJehova,
ngokuba akakho noyedwa ngaphandle kwakho;
futhi alikho idwala elinjengoNkulunkulu wethu.

Ababesuthile baqashelwa isinkwa;
ababelambile sebeyekile ukulamba;
yebo, oyinyumba uzele abayisikhombisa;
onabantwana abaningi uyawuma.

Abalwa noJehova
bayakuphahlazwa;
uyakuduma ezulwini phezu kwabo;
uJehova uyakwahlulela amajukujuku omhlaba,
anike inkosi yakhe amandla,
aphakamise uphondo logcotshiweyo wakhe.”

1:
“OSawule noJonathani
babethandeka, bemnandi;
ekuphileni nasekufeni kwabo kabahlukaniswanga;
babenejubane kunezinkozi,
babenamandla kunezingonyama.

“Ngidabukile ngawe mfowethu
Jonathani;
wawumnandi kakhulu kimi;
lwaluyisimangaliso kimi uthando lwakho,
ludlula uthando lwabesifazane.

22:
wathi:
“UJehova uyidwala lami,
nenqaba yami, nomkhululi wami;

Ekuhluphekeni kwami ngambiza
uJehova,
ngakhala kuNkulunkulu wami;
walizwa izwi lami esethempelini lakhe;
ukukhala kwami kwangena ezindlebeni zakhe.

Kwenyuka umusi emakhaleni akhe,
nomlilo odlayo emlonyeni wakhe;
amalahle avutha kuye.

Wakhwela phezu kwekherubi,*
wandiza;
wabonwa emaphikweni omoya.

Waselula isandla sakhe ephezulu,
wangibamba;
wangikhipha emanzini amaningi.

“UJehova wangivuza ngokokulunga
kwami;
wangibuyisela njengokuhlanzeka kwezandla zami.

Ngokuba ngizigcinile izindlela
zikaJehova;
angimukanga kuNkulunkulu wami ngokushinga.

“Kothembekileyo uyazibonakalisa
ethembekile;
kumuntu oqotho uyazibonakalisa eqotho;

kohlanzekileyo uyazibonakalisa
ehlanzekile;
koyisigwegwe uyazibonakalisa enenkani.

Ngokuba wena uyisibani sami,
Jehova;
uJehova uyakhanyisa ubumnyama bami.

Indlela kaNkulunkulu iphelele;
izwi likaJehova lihlanzekile;
yena uyisihlangu kubo bonke abaphephela kuye.

UNkulunkulu uyangibhincisa
amandla;
uyenza indlela yami ilunge,

yena owenza izinyawo zami zibe
njengezendluzelekazi,
angimise emagqumeni ami;

Wena unginikile isihlangu sensindiso
yakho;
ubumnene bakho bungikhulisile.

Amabanga okunyathela kwami
uwandisile;
amaqakala ami awaxegi.

Ngaziqeda, ngaziphahlaza, zaze
zahluleka ukuvuka;
zawa phansi kwezinyawo zami.

Ngabacolisisa njengothuli
lomhlabathi;
ngabagxoba, ngabalahla njengensila ezitaladini.

“Wangikhulula ezimpini zabantu
bami;
wangilonda ngaba yinhloko yabezizwe;
abantu engingabaziyo bangikhonza.

Abafo bazithoba phansi kwami;
banele ukungizwa nje ngendlebe,
base bengilalela.

“UJehova usekhona malidunyiswe
idwala lami;
makaphakanyiswe uNkulunkulu wensindiso yami,

19:
Ngokuba kuyakuphuma eJerusalema insali
nasentabeni yaseSiyoni abayakusinda;
ukushisekela kukaJehova kuyakufeza lokho.

16:
Ngokuba mkhulu uJehova,
udumisekile kakhulu;
uyesabeka phezu kwabo bonke onkulunkulu.

Malijabule izulu, umhlaba uthokoze;
makuthiwe ezizweni:
UJehova uyinkosi.

6:
Jehova Nkulunkulu,
ungafulatheli ogcotshiweyo wakho;
khumbula umusa wakho kuDavide inceku yakho.”

1:
wathi:
“Ngaphuma ngize esizalweni sikamame;
ngiyakubuyela khona ngize;
uJehova wapha, uJehova uthathile;
malibongwe igama likaJehova.”

3:
Lolo suku malube ngubumnyama;
uNkulunkulu makangalunaki ephezulu,
ukukhanya makungakhanyiswa kulo.

Ubumnyama nethunzi lokufa maluphiwe khona,
kuhlale ifu phezu kwalo;
okwenza mnyama usuku makulwesabise.

Ubusuku lobo isigayegaye masibubambe;
mabungajabuli phakathi kwezinsuku zomnyaka,
bungangeni phakathi komumo wezinyanga.

Izinkanyezi zokuhwelela kwabo maziphenduke ubumnyama;
mabulinde ukukhanya kungabikho,
bungaboni izinkophe zokusa,

4:
Kwema okuthile, kepha angaqonda ukubonakala kwakho;
isimo sasiphambi kwamehlo ami;
kwathula;
ngase ngizwa izwi, lathi:

5:
Abantwana baso bakude nokusindiswa,
bachotshozwa esangweni;
akakho obophulayo,

abakuvuna kwabo kudliwa ngabalambileyo,
bakukhipha nasemeveni;
abanxanelayo basezela impahla yabo.

Ngokuba uma ezwisa ubuhlungu,
ubuye abophe;
uyalimaza, kepha izandla zakhe zibuye zelaphe.

Uyakwazi ukuthi itende lakho linokuthula;
uyakuhambela indlu yakho,
awuyikusilalelwa lutho.

6:
Ngokuba imicibisholo kaSomandla ikimi;
isihlungu sayo siphuzwa ngumoya wami;
izesabiso zikaNkulunkulu ziyangehlela.

Manje, qalani ukungibuka;
kuyakuba sobala,
uma ngiqamba amanga.

7:
Inyama yami yembesiwe izimpethu namagade othuli;
isikhumba sami siyaphola,
sibuye sibhicike.

Ngiyanengwa yiwo;
mangingahlali njalo;
ngiyeke, ngokuba imihla yami iyize.

9:
Umhlaba unikezwe esandleni sababi;
uyasibekela ubuso babahluleli bawo;
uma kungesiye, pho, ngubani na?

10:
“Umphefumulo wami ukhathele ukuhamba kwami;
ngiyazinikela ekukhaleni,
ngikhulume ngomunyu womphefumulo wami.

Ngiyakusho kuNkulunkulu ukuthi:
‘Ungangilahli;
ngazise ukuthi uphikisanelani nami na?

Izandla zakho zingibumbile,
zangenza ngokupheleleyo nxazonke;
nokho uyangichitha.

11:
Ngokuba uthi:
‘Ukufundisa kwami kulungile;
ngimhlophe emehlweni akho.’

Kepha amehlo ababi ayakufiphala;
abayikuba nandawo yokuphephela;
ithemba labo liyakuba ngukuphuma komphefumulo.”

12:
Kodwa nami nginengqondo njengani,
angahlulwa yinina;
ngubani ongazazi izinto ezinje na?

Amatende abacindezelayo anokuthula;
abathukuthelisayo uNkulunkulu bayalondeka,
abaletha unkulunkulu wabo ngezandla zabo.

13:
Bheka, uyakungibulala,
anginathemba;
nokho ngiyakuvikela izindlela zami ebusweni bakhe.

14:
amanzi ayagubha amatshe;
ukuphuphuma kwawo kuyakhukhula uthuli lomhlaba;
kanjalo uyachitha nethemba lomuntu.

Uyamsukela kuze kube phakade,
amuke;
uyaguqula ubuso bakhe, ummukise.

Amadodana akhe ayadunyiswa,
engazi yena;
ayeyiswa, engakuqondi.

15:
Ngumlomo wakho okulahlayo,
akusimi;
izindebe zakho ziyafakaza ngawe.

Izwi lengebhe lisezindlebeni zakhe;
lapho ehlezi kahle,
uyakufikelwa ngumphangi.

Akayikusuka ebumnyameni;
ilangabi liyakushisa amagatsha akhe,
amuke ngokuphefumula komlomo kaNkulunkulu.

16:
Ungicindezele, kungubufakazi;
ukonda kwami kuyangivukela,
kufakaze ebusweni bami.

Ulaka lwakhe luyangidwengula,
lungizingele;
uyangigedlela amazinyo;
isitha sami singicijisela amehlo aso.

Ngangihlezi kahle, wangichoboza;
wangibamba ngentamo,
wangiphahlaza;
wangimisa ngibe yisigcibisholo.

Abacibishelayo bakhe bangihaqa;
uyaqhekeza izinso zami engenasihawu;
uchithela inyongo yami emhlabathini.

Namanje bheka,
ufakazi wami usezulwini;
ummeli wami usezindaweni eziphakemeyo.

19:
Amabutho akhe afika kanyekanye,
alungise indlela ukuba angisukele;
amisa nxazonke zetende lami.

Abagogobele endlini yami
nezincekukazi zami bangishaya umfokazi;
ngingowezizwe emehlweni abo.

Ngibiza inceku yami,
kayingiphenduli;
ngiyayinxusa ngomlomo wami.

Amathambo ami anamathela
esikhumbeni sami nasenyameni yami;
ngisinde ngokulambisa kuphela.

engiyakumbona uqobo lwami;
amehlo ami ayakumbona,
kungabi njengomfokazi;
okuphakathi kwami kuyaphela esifubeni sami.

20:
Uyakundiza njengephupho,
angabe esafunyanwa;
uyakuxoshwa njengombono wasebusuku.

Ugwinyile ingcebo;
uyakubuye ayihlanze;
uNkulunkulu uyakuyikhipha esiswini sakhe.

Ngokuba ucindezele,
washiya abampofu;
uhlwithile indlu, angabuye ayakhe.

Uyawukhipha uphume emzimbeni wakhe;
nxa uphuma unyampuza enyongweni,
abesehlelwa yingebhe.

Ubumnyama bonke bubekelelwe ingcebo yakhe;
umlilo ongavuthelwanga uyakuyidla,
uchithe okusele etendeni lakhe.

21:
Lapho ngikhumbula nje,
ngishaywa luvalo;
ukwesaba kubamba inyama yami.

Amagabade asesigodini ayakuba mnandi kuye;
bonke abantu bayakudonswa emva kwakhe,
njengokuba bengenakubalwa nababe phambi kwakhe.

23:
nangasenyakatho ekusebenzeni kwakhe, kepha akabonwa;
ujikela ngaseningizimu,
kepha akabonakali.

Ngokuba uyayazi indlela yami;
esengivivinyile,
ngiyakuphuma njengegolide.

Unyawo lwami lunamathele ezinyathelweni zakhe;
ngigcinile indlela yakhe,
angiphambukanga.

ngokuba anginqunywanga,
bungakafiki ubumnyama;
wangifihlela ukuhlwa.

24:
Bheka, njengezimbongolo ehlane
bayaphumela emisebenzini yabo befunisisa ukudla;
ihlane lingukudla kwabo abakunika abantwana babo.

Benza amafutha phakathi kwezingange zabahluphi;
banyathela izikhamo zewayini,
kepha bayoma.

Bexoshwe emzini abafayo bayabubula;
imiphefumulo yabalimeleyo iyakhala,
kepha uNkulunkulu akanaki lokho okubi.

“Bakhona abakuhlubukile ukukhanya;
abazi indlela yakho,
abanamatheli emikhondweni yakho.

Umbulali uvuka ekuseni,
abulale ompofu noswelayo;
ebusuku unjengesela.

Bafohla izindlu sekumnyama;
emini bayazivalela;
ukukhanya abakwazi.

“Banejubane ebusweni bamanzi;
izabelo zabo ziqalekisiwe emhlabeni;
abasayikuphendukela endleleni yezivini.

Isizalo siyamkhohlwa;
izimpethu ziyamsobozela;
akasayikukhunjulwa;
ukungalungi kuyaphulwa njengomuthi.

Bayaphakanyiswa;
emva kwesikhashana abasekho;
bayaphela njengabanye, bafe;
babuna njengezihloko zezikhwebu.

27:
Uyalala enothile,
angakuphindi kodwa;
uyavula amehlo akhe, abe engasekho.

28:
Ubumnyama bubekelwa umkhawulo;
kuyacingwa kuze kube sekupheleni konke
amatshe esigayegaye nethunzi lokufa.

Baqhekeza umgodi kude nalapho behlala khona abantu,
lapho bekhohlakele khona lunyawo;
bayalenga, bajikajika kude nabantu.

Wathi kubantu: ‘Bhekani, ukwesaba
iNkosi lokhu kungukuhlakanipha;
ukusuka ebubini kungukuqonda.’ ”

29:
Ngembatha ukulunga,
kwaba yisambatho kimi;
ukwahlulelwa kwami kwakunjengengubo nomqhele kimi.

Bangilindela njengemvula;
bangikhamisela imilomo yabo
njengokukhamisela imvula yamuva.

30:
Bakhululile imichilo yabo,
bangithobisa;
balahlile itomu phambi kwami.

Ngakwesokunene kuvuka amachwensa;
agudlumeza izinyawo zami,
anginqwabelela izindlela zokubhubhisa.

Ingebhe ithululwa phezu kwami;
njengomoya luyaxoshwa udumo lwami;
inhlalakahle yami iyadlula njengefu.

“Ngikhala kuwe,
kepha awungiphenduli;
ngimi lapha, uyangibuka nje.

Izibilini zami ziyaxhuxhuzela,
aziphumuli;
izinsuku zosizi zingehlele.

Ngihamba ngimnyama,
kungenziwanga yilanga;
ngisukuma ebandleni ngikhala.

Isikhumba sami simnyama,
siyebuza kimi;
amathambo ami ashile ngokushisa.

31:
Owangenza mina esiswini,
wabenza nabo;
owasibumba esizalweni munye.

32:
Nganilalela nina;
bhekani, kwakungekho noyedwa owamahlula uJobe
nowaphendula amazwi akhe phakathi kwenu.

33:
Inyama yakhe iyadliwa,
ingabe isabonwa;
amathambo akhe akade engabonakali aseqhamukile.

34:
Phezu kokwahlulelwa kwami ngishaywa onamanga;
inxeba lami alinakupholiswa,
noma ngingenasiphambeko.’

“Ngalokho ngizweni nina bantu abanokuqonda;
makube kude noNkulunkulu ukuba enze okubi,
nakuSomandla ukuba enze ukona.

Bayafa ngokuphazima kweso;
phakathi kwamabili abantu bayathuthumela,
banyamalale;
amaqhawe ayasuswa,
kepha kungengasandla.

Ngalokho uyazi imisebenzi yabo;
uyabagumbuqela ebusuku,
bachotshozwe.

Ngokuba uyenezela ukuhlubuka esonweni sakhe;
ushaya ihlombe phakathi kwethu,
andise amazwi akhe kuNkulunkulu.”

36:
“Bheka, uNkulunkulu unamandla,
kepha kadeleli muntu;
mkhulu emandleni okuqonda.

Bheka, uNkulunkulu uphakeme,
asimqondi;
umumo weminyaka yakhe ayinakuphenywa.

37:
Emva kwalo kuduma izwi;
uduma ngezwi lobukhosi bakhe;
kalumisi unyazi, lapho lizwakala izwi lakhe.

USomandla singemqonde;
mkhulu ngamandla nangokwahlulela;
ngokulunga kwakhe okukhulu akoni lutho.

38:
ngathi:
‘Uyakufika lapha, kepha ungadluli;
lapha amaza akho aziqhenyayo ayakumiswa,’ na?

39:
Iphatha kalukhuni amazinyane ayo,
kungathi awasiwo awayo;
ayinangebhe yokuthi umshikashika wayo ungaba yize.

Amazinyane alo amunca igazi;
lapho kukhona abagwaziweyo,
lukhona nalo.”

40:
“Bheka, angiyinto yalutho;
ngingakuphendula ngokuthini na?
Ngibeka isandla sami emlonyeni wami.

41:
Beka isandla sakho kuye;
khumbula ukulwa;
awusayikukuphinda.

4:
Thukuthelani ningoni;
zindlani enhliziyweni yenu okhukhweni lwenu,
nithule. Sela*

5:
Ngokuba alikho iqiniso emlonyeni wabo;
izibilini zabo zingukonakala:
umphimbo wabo uyithuna elivulekileyo;
bayathopha ngolimi lwabo.

6:
Yiba nomusa kimi, Jehova,
ngokuba ngidangele;
ngiphilise, Jehova, ngokuba amathambo ami ayathuthumela,

Ngikhathele ukububula kwami;
ngimanzisa icansi lami njalo ebusuku,
ngimanzisa ukhukho lwami ngezinyembezi zami.

Zonke izitha zami ziyakujabha,
zishaywe luvalo;
ziyakuhlehla, zijabhe ngokuphazima kweso.

7:
Sukuma, Jehova, ngentukuthelo yakho,
uvuke ngenxa yolaka lwezitha zami, ungimele;
ngokuba uyalezile ukwahlulela.

UJehova uyahlulela izizwe;
ngahlulele, Jehova,
ngokulunga kwami nangobuqotho bami obukimi.

9:
Izitha ziphelile, zachitheka kuze kube phakade;
imizi wayisimbula,
ukukhunjulwa kwayo kwaphela nya.

Yiba nomusa kimi, Jehova;
kubone engihlupheka ngakho ngabangizondayo
wena ongiphakamisa emasangweni okufa,

Vuka, Jehova!
Mawungavumi ukuba abantu bahlule;
abezizwe mabahlulelwe ebusweni bakho.

10:
Izindlela zakhe zithembekile izikhathi zonke;
izahlulelo zakho ziphakeme kakhulu kunokubona kwakhe;
zonke izitha zakhe uyazidelela.

Uhlezi ezindaweni zokuqamekela zemizi;
ezindaweni ezisithekileyo uyambulala ongenacala;
amehlo akhe ayamhlwaya othithibeleyo.

Endaweni esithekileyo uqamekela njengengonyama emphandwini wayo;
uhlomele ukumbamba ohluphekileyo;
uyambamba ohluphekileyo ngokumngenisa esihibeni sakhe.

Ubonile wena;
ngokuba ukukhathazeka nokuhlupheka uyakubona wena
ukuze ukubeke esandleni sakho;
othithibeleyo uyazinikela kuwe;
wena ungumsizi wentandane.

Yaphula ingalo yomubi;
buphenyisise ububi besoni,
ukuze ungabe usabufumana.

Jehova, uyakuzwa ukulangazela kwabamnene;
uyaqinisa inhliziyo yabo,
indlebe yakho uyibeka kubo

11:
Ngiyaphephela kuJehova;
nisho kanjani kuwo umphefumulo wami ukuthi:
“Balekela entabeni yenu njengenyoni, na?

UJehova uyamhlola olungileyo;
kepha omubi nothanda ubudlwangudlwangu
umphefumulo wakhe uyamzonda.

Unisa izihibe phezu kwababi;
umlilo nesibabule nomoya oshisayo
kuyisabelo sendebe yabo.

Ngokuba uJehova ulungile,
uyathanda ukulunga;
oqotho uyakubheka ubuso bakhe.

12:
Bakhuluma amanga,
kwaba yilowo nalowo kumakhelwane wakhe;
ngezindebe ezithophayo bakhuluma nganhliziyombili.

abathi: “Siyakunqoba ngolimi lwethu;
izindebe zethu zinathi;
ngubani oyinkosi phezu kwethu na?”

15:
ongahlebi ngolimi lwakhe,
ongamoni umngane wakhe,
nongamhlazi umakhelwane wakhe;

obuka onengekayo ngokuzakumenyanya,
kepha ebazisa abamesabayo uNkulunkulu;
ofunga ngokuzakumlimaza,
nokho angalaphuli izwi lakhe;

ongatsheleki muntu imali yakhe ukuba izale,
nongamukeli umvuzo ngongenacala;
owenza lokhu akayikuzanyazanyiswa naphakade.

16:
Ziningi izinhlupheko zabazizuzela omunye unkulunkulu;
angiyikunikela ngeminikelo yabo yegazi;
angiyikuwaphatha amagama abo ngezindebe zami.

UJehova uyisabelo esahlukaniselwe mina,
nendebe yami;
wena uqinisa ifa lami.

Uyakungazisa indlela yokuphila;
ukugcwala kwenjabulo kusebusweni bakho;
intokozo isesandleni sakho sokunene kuze kube phakade.

17:
Uyalinga inhliziyo yami;
ungihambele ebusuku,
uyangihlolisisa, awufumani lutho;
ngiyahlosa ukuba umlomo wami ungaphambuki.

Ngikhala kuwe, ngokuba uyangizwa, Nkulunkulu;
beka indlebe yakho kimi,
uzwe izwi lami.

18:
Ekuhluphekeni kwami ngambiza uJehova,
ngakhala kuNkulunkulu wami;
walizwa izwi lami esethempelini lakhe;
ukukhala kwami phambi kwakhe kwangena ezindlebeni zakhe.

Umhlaba wawusuzamazama, wadikizela;
izisekelo zezintaba zathuthumela,
zagubhuzela ngokuba ethukuthele.

Kwenyuka umusi emakhaleni akhe,
nomlilo odlayo emlonyeni wakhe;
amalahle avutha kuye.

Ubumnyama wabenza isisibekelo,
idokodo lakhe elimphahlayo;
amanzi amnyama, amafu anzima.

UJehova waduma ezulwini;
oPhezukonke walizwakalisa izwi lakhe:
isichotho namalahle avuthayo.

Kwase kubonakala imisinga yamanzi;
izisekelo zomhlaba zambulwa ngesijeziso sakho, Jehova,
ngokufutha komoya wamakhala akho.

Indlela kaNkulunkulu iphelele;
izwi likaJehova lihlanzekile;
yena uyisihlangu kubo bonke abaphephela kuye.

Wangikhulula ezimpini zabantu;
wangimisa ngaba yinhloko yabezizwe;
abantu engingabaziyo bangikhonza.

Banele ukungizwa nje ngendlebe,
base bengilalela;
abafo bazithoba phansi kwami.

UJehova usekhona,
malidunyiswe iDwala lami;
makaphakanyiswe uNkulunkulu wensindiso yami,

Uyenza insindiso ibe nkulu enkosini yakhe;
uyenza umusa kogcotshiweyo wakhe uDavide
nasenzalweni yakhe kuze kube phakade.

19:
Ukuphuma kwalo kusemkhawulweni wezulu;
ukuzungeza kwalo kuya ekugcineni kwalo;
akukho okufihlelwe ukushisa kwalo.

20:
Siyahalalisa ngensindiso yakho,
siphakamise ibhandela* egameni likaNkulunkulu wethu;
uJehova makagcwalise zonke izicelo zakho.

21:
Ngokuba babehlosa okubi,
baceba icebo;
kepha bayahluleka.

Mawuphakame, Jehova,
emandleni akho;
thina siyakuhlabelela, sidumise amandla akho.

22:
bathi: “Zinikele kuJehova;
makamsindise, amkhulule,
njengokuba emthanda.”

Ngichithiwe njengamanzi;
onke amathambo ami enyele;
inhliziyo yami injengengcina,
incibilikile phakathi kwezibilini zami.

Amandla ami omile njengodengezi;
ulimi lwami lunamathela olwangeni lwami;
ungibeka othulini lokufa.

Ngokuba izinja ziyangibungayela;
umbonda wababi ungizungezile;
izandla zami nezinyawo zami bazibhobozile.

Nina enesaba uJehova, mbongeni;
nina nonke nzalo kaJakobe, mdumiseni,
nimesabe nina nonke nzalo ka-Israyeli.

Kuyakuvela kuwe ukudumisa kwami ebandleni elikhulu;
izithembiso zami ngiyakuzigcwalisa
phambi kwabamesabayo.

Abamnene bayakudla, basuthe;
abafuna uJehova bayakumdumisa;
inhliziyo yenu mayiphile kuze kube phakade.

Bonke abacebileyo bomhlaba bayakudla, bakhuleke;
bonke abehlela othulini bayakukhothama phambi kwakhe,
naye ongenakugcina umphefumulo wakhe ekuphileni.

23:
Ulungisa itafula phambi kwami ebusweni bezitha zami;
ugcoba ikhanda lami ngamafutha;
indebe yami iyachichima.

Impela okuhle nomusa kuyakungilandela
imihla yonke yokuphila kwami;
ngiyakuhlala endlini kaJehova kuze kube phakade.

25:
Nkulunkulu wami,
ngiyethemba kuwe;
mawungangijabhisi;
izitha zami mazingethabi ngami.

Ngihambise eqinisweni lakho, ungifundise,
ngokuba wena unguNkulunkulu wensindiso yami;
ngilindela wena usuku lonke.

Ungazikhumbuli izono zobusha bami neziphambeko zami;
ngikhumbule ngokomusa
wakho ngenxa yobubele bakho, Jehova.

Londoloza umphefumulo wami, ungikhulule;
mawungangijabhisi,
ngokuba ngiphephela kuwe.

26:
Ngahlulele, Jehova,
ngokuba ngihamba ekulungeni kwami;
ngithemba uJehova, angiyikuntenga.

27:
UJehova ungukukhanya kwami nensindiso yami;
ngizakwesaba bani na?
UJehova uyinqaba yokuphila kwami;
ngizakuba novalo ngobani na?

Unganginikeli entandweni yezitha zami;
ngokuba ofakazi bamanga bangivukele kanye nabafutha
ukudlozomela.

Lindela uJehova, uqine,
inhliziyo yakho ime isibindi;
yebo, lindela uJehova.

28:
Banike njengokwenza kwabo nanjengobubi bemisebenzi yabo;
banike njengokwenza kwezandla zabo,
baphindisele abakwenzileyo.

Ngokuba abayinaki imisebenzi kaJehova
nokwenza kwezandla zakhe;
uyakubadiliza, angabakhi.

UJehova ungamandla ami nesihlangu sami;
inhliziyo yami ithembe kuye, ngasizwa;
ngakho-ke inhliziyo yami iyethaba;
ngizakumdumisa ngesihlabelelo sami.

29:
Izwi likaJehova liphezu kwamanzi,
uNkulunkulu wenkazimulo uyaduma;
uJehova uphezu kwamanzi amakhulu.

Izwi likaJehova liphunzisa izimbabala;
lihluba amahlathi;
nasethempelini lakhe konke kuthi: “Udumo!”

30:
Ngiyakuphakamisa, Jehova,
ngokuba ungikhuphulile;
awuvumanga ukuba izitha zami zijabule phezu kwami.

Waphendula ukukhala kwami kwaba ngukusina;
wangikhumula izingubo zami zokulila,
wangembathisa ukujabula,

31:
Ithemba lami ngilibeka kuwe Jehova;
mawungangijabhisi naphakade;
ngikhulule ngokulunga kwakho.

Ngokuba wena uyidwala lami nenqaba yami;
ngenxa yegama lakho uyakungihola,
ungiqondise.

Ngenxa yezitha zami zonke sengaba yisihlamba,
ikakhulu kubakhelwane bami ngaba ngobesabisayo abangane bami;
abangibona endleleni bayangibalekela.

Mina-ke ngithe ovalweni lwami:
Ngixoshiwe emehlweni akho;
nokho walizwa izwi lokunxusa kwami ekukhaleni kwami kuwe.

Mthandeni uJehova nina nonke enimkhonzayo;
uJehova uyabalondoloza abakholekileyo,
amphindisele kakhulu ozidlayo.

32:
Wena uyindawo yami yokucasha;
uyangilondoloza ngingahlupheki;
ungiphahla ngenjabulo yokukhululwa. Sela*

Ningabi njengehhashi nembongolo engenangqondo;
umkhala netomu yimvunulo yayo yokuyiqondisa,
uma ingasondeli kuwe.

35:
Hosha umkhonto, uvimbe indlela kwabangizingelayo;
yisho kuwo umphefumulo wami, uthi:
“Mina ngiyinsindiso yakho.”

Ukubhujiswa makumehlele engazelele;
inetha lakhe alibeke ngasesitha malimbambe yena;
makawele kulo kube ngukubhujiswa kwakhe.

Kanti ekuguleni kwabo mina ngangembethe ezokuzila;
umphefumulo wami ngawuhlupha ngokuzila ukudla;
umkhuleko wami wabuyela esifubeni sami.

Kepha ekuweni kwami bahlekisa ngami, babuthana ndawonye;
abashayi engingabaziyo bangibunganyela;
badumaza bengayeki.

Ngahlulele ngokulunga kwakho,
Jehova Nkulunkulu wami;
mabangajabuli ngami.

Mabajabhe,
babe namahloni bonke abajabula ngokuhlupheka kwami;
abazikhukhumeza ngami mabembathiswe ukujabha nendumazo.

36:
Uceba okubi ecansini lakhe,
uzimisa endleleni engalungile;
okubi kakwenyanyi.

Ukulunga kwakho kunjengezintaba ezinkulukazi,
ukwahlulela kwakho kulutwa olukhulu;
usindisa abantu nezilwane, Jehova.

37:
Themba kuJehova,
wenze okulungileyo;
hlala ezweni, uzondle ngokukholeka;

Pheza ukuthukuthela;
yeka ulaka, ungakhathazeki;
kubanga ukona nje.

Kuse ngumzuzwana, omubi angabe esabakho;
kuyakuthi lapho uhlola indawo yakhe,
uyakube engasekho.

Kade ngimusha, manje sengimdala;
angizange ngibone olungileyo eshiyiwe
nenzalo yakhe iphanza ukudla.

Lindela uJehova, ulonde indlela yakhe;
uzakukuphakamisa, udle ifa lomhlaba,
ubukele lapho ababi bechithwa khona.

Mbhekisise ongasolekiyo,
umbone oqotho;
ngokuba umuntu wokuthula, ukugcina kwakhe kuhle.

UJehova uyabasiza, abakhulule;
ubakhulula kwababi, abasindise,
ngokuba bayamethemba.

38:
Inhliziyo yami iyagquma kakhulu;
amandla ami angishiyile,
ngisho nokukhanya kwamehlo ami akusekho kimi.

Abathandekayo bami nabahlobo bami
bemi kude nokuhlupheka kwami;
abakwethu bemi kude laphaya.

Abafuna umphefumulo wami bayangicupha;
abafuna ukungilimaza bakhuluma okubi,
bazindla inkohliso usuku lonke.

39:
Inhliziyo yami yavutha phakathi kwami;
kwaphembeka umlilo ngisazindla;
ngakhuluma ngolimi lwami.

“Jehova, ngazise ukuphela kwami,
nesilinganiso sezinsuku zami ukuba siyini;
mangazi ukuthi ngingodlulayo.

Bheka, izinsuku zami wazenza zaba ngangobubanzi besandla;
imihla yokuphila kwami ayilutho kuwe;
impela yilowo nalowo muntu ungumoya nje,
noma eqine kangakanani. Sela*

“Impela umuntu uhamba njengesithunzi nje;
impela uzikhathaza ngokuyize nje;
unqwabela imfuyo,
kepha akazi ukuthi ngubani ozakuyibutha.

Nxa ulaya umuntu ngesijeziso ngenxa yeziphambeko,
ubuhle bakhe ubenza buphele njengenundu;
yilowo nalowo muntu ungumoya nje. Sela*

“Yizwa umkhuleko wami, Jehova,
ulalele ukumemeza kwami;
ungathuli ngezinyembezi zami,
ngokuba ngingumfokazi kuwe;
ngiyisihambi njengokhokho bami bonke.

40:
Bengilindela uJehova;
wayesezikhothamisela kimi,
wezwa ukukhala kwami.

Jehova Nkulunkulu wami,
ziningi izimangaliso zakho ozenzileyo,
nezizindlo zakho ngathi;
akukho okungafaniswa nawe;
uma ngiyilanda, ngiyisho,
miningi kunokuba ibalwe.

Umhlatshelo nomnikelo wokudla awuwuthandi;
izindlebe zami uzibhobozile;
umnikelo wokushiswa nomnikelo wesono awuwubizi.

Ngishumayelile ukulunga ebandleni elikhulu;
bheka, angizivalanga izindebe zami;
Jehova, wena uyakwazi.

Ukulunga kwakho angikuthukusanga enhliziyweni yami;
ngashumayela ukukholeka kwakho nensindiso yakho;
umusa wakho neqiniso lakho angikufihlelanga ibandla elikhulu.

Ngokuba izinhlupheko ezingenakubalwa zingihaqile,
iziphambeko zami zingificile,
angaze ngaba nakubona;
ziningi kunezinwele zekhanda lami;
inhliziyo yami ingishiyile.

Noma ngihlupheka, ngimpofu,
iNkosi iyanginaka;
wena ungumsizi wami noMsindisi wami;
Nkulunkulu wami, mawungalibali.

41:
UJehova uyakumlondoloza, amphilise;
uyakubusiswa emhlabeni;
awuyikumnikela entandweni yezitha zakhe.

42:
Umphefumulo wami womela uNkulunkulu,
uNkulunkulu ophilayo;
ngiyakufika nini, ngibonakale phambi kukaNkulunkulu, na?

Emini uJehova uyaleza umusa wakhe;
ebusuku isihlabelelo sakhe sikimi,
ngikhuleke kuNkulunkulu wokuphila kwami.

44:
Nguwe owabaxosha abezizwe ngesandla sakho,
kepha bona wabatshala;
wazichitha izizwe, kepha bona wabandisa.

Konke lokho kusehlele,
kodwa asikukhohlwanga wena;
asisaphulanga isivumelwano sakho.

45:
Inhliziyo yami iyachichima ngendaba enhle;
ngikhuluma igama engiliqambe ngenkosi;
ulimi lwami lulusiba loloba ngokushesha.

Umuhle wena kunabantwana babantu;
ubuhle buthululelwe ezindebeni zakho;
ngakho-ke uNkulunkulu ukubusisile kuze kube phakade.

Hlahlameleka ebukhosini bakho,
uqhubeke ngenxa yeqiniso nokuthobeka nokulunga;
isandla sakho sokunene siyakukufundisa izinto ezesabekayo.

Imicibisholo yakho ibukhali,
izizwe ziyawa phansi kwakho;
isenhliziyweni yezitha zenkosi.

Isihlalo sakho sobukhosi, Nkulunkulu,
singesaphakade naphakade;
intonga yobuqotho iyintonga yombuso wakho.

Amadodakazi amakhosi aphakathi kwabesifazane bakho abadumileyo;
inkosikazi imi ngakwesokunene sakho,
ihlobe igolide lase-Ofiri.

46:
UNkulunkulu uphakathi kwawo,
awuyikuzanyazanyiswa;
uNkulunkulu uyakuwusiza ngovivi lokusa.

Izizwe ziyaxokozela;
imibuso iyazamazama;
uphumisela izwi lakhe,
umhlaba uncibilike.

Thulani, niqonde ukuthi mina nginguNkulunkulu;
ngiyakuphakama phakathi kwabezizwe,
ngiphakame emhlabeni.

48:
Njengalo igama lakho, Nkulunkulu,
kunjalo ukubongwa kwakho kuze kube semikhawulweni yomhlaba;
isandla sakho sokunene sigcwele ukulunga.

50:
UNkulunkulu wethu uyeza, akayikuthula;
umlilo udla phambi kwakhe;
uphahlwe yisivunguvungu esikhulu.

ngibize ngosuku lwenhlupheko;
ngiyakukukhulula,
wena uyakungidumisa.”

Lokho ukwenzile, ngathula;
ushaye sengathi nginjengawe;
ngizakukulaya, ngikubeke phambi kwamehlo akho.

Onikela ngomnikelo wokubonga uyangidumisa;
oqaphela indlela yakhe
ngiyakumbonisa insindiso kaNkulunkulu.”

51:
Ngihawukele, Nkulunkulu,
ngokomusa wakho;
yesula iziphambeko zami ngokobubele bakho obukhulu.

Bheka, uthanda iqiniso
ngaphakathi enhliziyweni;
wongifundisa ukuhlakanipha ekujuleni kwenhliziyo.

Ngokuba awuwuthandi umhlatshelo;
noma bengizakukunika umnikelo wokushiswa,
ubungayikuthokoza ngawo.

Iminikelo kaNkulunkulu ingumoya owaphukileyo;
inhliziyo eyaphukileyo nedabukileyo,
Nkulunkulu, awuyikuyidelela.

52:
Ngakho-ke uNkulunkulu uyakukubhidliza kuze kube phakade;
uyakukubamba, akukhiphe etendeni lakho,
akusiphule ezweni labaphilayo. Sela*

Ngizakukudumisa kuze kube phakade, ngokuba ukwenzile;
ngizakulindela igama lakho,
ngokuba lihle phambi kwabangcwele bakho.

53:
Besaba nokwesaba,
lapho kungekho okwesabisayo;
ngokuba uNkulunkulu wasakaza amathambo akhe owamisa ngakuwe;
wena ubajabhisile,
ngokuba uNkulunkulu ubalahlile.

54:
Ngokuba abafo bangivukele;
izidlova zifuna umphefumulo wami;
azimbekile uNkulunkulu phambi kwazo. Sela*

Ngizakunikela kuwe ngesihle;
ngizakulibonga igama lakho, Jehova,
ngokuba lihle.

55:
ngenxa yezwi lesitha,
ngenxa yokucindezela komubi;
ngokuba bagingqela okubi phezu kwami;
bangizingela bethukuthele.

Ngokuba akusiso isitha esingiklolodelayo;
ngabe ngiyakuthwala;
akusiye ongizondayo oziphakamise phezu kwami;
ngabe ngamcashela;

Umlomo wakhe ubushelezi kunephehlwa,
kepha inhliziyo yakhe iyimpi;
amazwi akhe athambile kunamafutha;
nokho ayizinkemba ezikhokhiweyo.

Wena Nkulunkulu uyakubaphonsa egodini lokubhubhisa;
abantu begazi nenkohliso abayikufinyelela nasenxenyeni yezinsuku zabo;
kepha mina ngizakwethemba wena.

56:
Yiba nomusa kimi, Nkulunkulu,
ngokuba abantu bafuna ukungigwinya;
usuku lonke bayangicindezela belwa.

KuNkulunkulu ngiyakudumisa izwi lakhe;
ngithemba uNkulunkulu, angiyikwesaba;
inyama ingangenzani na?

Ukuzula kwami ukubalile wena;
yetha izinyembezi zami egabheni lakho;
azikho encwadini yakho na?

57:
Yiba nomusa kimi, Nkulunkulu;
yiba nomusa kimi.
Ngokuba umphefumulo wami uphephela kuwe;
ngifuna ukukhosela ethunzini lamaphiko akho,
zize zidlule izinhlupheko.

Izinyathelo zami bazibekele ugibe;
umphefumulo wami ugobile;
bembile igebe phambi kwami,
kwakhalakathela bona kulo. Sela*

Inhliziyo yami iduduzekile, Nkulunkulu;
inhliziyo yami iduduzekile;
ngizakuhlabelela, ngihube.

Vuka, mphefumulo wami;
vukani, lugubhu nehabhu!*
Ngizakuvusa ukusa.

58:
Isihlungu sabo sinjengesihlungu senyoka;
banjengebululu eliyisithulu,
elivimba indlebe yalo,

Mabaphele njengamanzi agobhozayo;
nxa ekhomba ngemicibisholo yakhe,
mayibe sengathi iqundekile.

59:
Ziyagijima, zizilungisele,
kungekho cala kimi;
vuka, ungihlangabeze, ubone.

Izwi lezindebe zazo liyisono somlomo wazo;
mazibanjwe ekuzidleni kwazo
nangenxa yesiqalekiso namanga eziwakhulumayo.

Mandla ami, ngizakuhubela wena;
ngokuba uNkulunkulu uyinqaba yami,
unguNkulunkulu wami womusa.

60:
Uzamazamisile umhlaba, wawudabula izimfa;
zivale izimfa zawo,
ngokuba uyazamazama.

UMowabi uyisitsha sami sokuhlambela;
phezu kuka-Edomi ngiphonsa isicathulo sami;
yethaba ngami, Filistiya.”

61:
Ngikhala kuwe ngisemkhawulweni womhlaba,
lapho inhliziyo yami isebuthakathakeni;
ngiholele edwaleni eliphakeme kunami.

62:
Thembani kuye ngezikhathi zonke nina bantu,
nithulule inhliziyo yenu phambi kwakhe;
uNkulunkulu uyisiphephelo sethu. Sela*

Nomusa ungowakho, Nkosi;
ngokuba wena umphindisela umuntu
njengokwenza kwakhe.

63:
Nkulunkulu, wena unguNkulunkulu wami,
ngiyakufuna ekuseni;
umphefumulo wami womele wena;
inyama yami ilangazelela wena
ezweni elomileyo eligagadekileyo,
lapho amanzi engekho khona.

Kepha inkosi iyakuthokoza ngoNkulunkulu;
bonke abafunga yena bayakuzibonga;
ngokuba umlomo wabakhuluma amanga uyakuvalwa.

64:
Baqinela icebo elibi;
bakhuluma ngokufihla izingibe;
bathi: “Ngubani oyakusibona na?”

Bonke abantu bayashaywa luvalo;
bayakushumayela izenzo zikaNkulunkulu,
baqonde akwenzileyo.

65:
Abakhile emikhawulweni yomhlaba
bayesaba ngezibonakaliso zakho;
uyethabisa impumalanga nentshonalanga.

Uhambela umhlaba, unisa imvula,
uwuvundisa kakhulu;
umfula kaNkulunkulu ugcwele amanzi;
ubalungisela abantu ukudla,
ngokuba uwulungisa kanjalo umhlaba.

Amadlelo embethe izimvu,
nezigodi zisibekelwe ngamabele;
konke kuyajabula, kuhlabelele.

66:
Ulwandle waluguqula lwaba yizwe elomileyo;
bawela umfula ngezinyawo;
lapho sathokoza kuye.

Ubusa ngamandla akhe kuze kube phakade;
amehlo akhe ayahlozinga izizwe;
abanenkani mabangaziphakamisi. Sela*

Wavumela abantu ukuba bakhwele phezu kwamakhanda ethu;
sangena emlilweni nasemanzini;
kepha wasikhiphela ekubuseni.

Ngiyakunikela kuwe iminikelo yokushiswa yezinonileyo
kanye nephunga lezinqama;
ngiyakunikela ngezinkunzi nangezimpongo. Sela*

67:
Izizwe mazijabule, zethabe;
ngokuba izizwe uzahlulela ngokulunga,
uzihola izizwe emhlabeni. Sela*

68:
Makavuke uNkulunkulu,
zihlakazeke izitha zakhe;
abamzondayo babaleka phambi kwakhe.

Bamukiswa njengokumukiswa komusi;
njengokuncibilika kwengcina phambi komlilo
ababi bachithwa phambi kukaNkulunkulu.

Kepha abalungileyo bayajabula;
bayethaba phambi kukaNkulunkulu
bethokoza nokuthokoza.

Hlabelelani kuNkulunkulu,
nidumise igama lakhe;
menzeleni umendo lowo odabula amahlane;
igama lakhe linguJehova;
yethabani phambi kwakhe,

uNkulunkulu ohlalisa imihlalaqha ezindlini,
akhiphele iziboshwa ekubuseni;
ngabahlubukileyo bodwa abakhe ezweni elomileyo.

Izinqola zikaNkulunkulu ziyizinkulungwane ezingamashumi amabili,
izinkulungwane nezinkulungwane;
iNkosi iphakathi kwazo;
iSinayi lisendaweni engcwele.

Mayibongwe iNkosi.
Iyasithwala imihla ngemihla;
uNkulunkulu uyinsindiso yethu. Sela*

UNkulunkulu wakho ukumisele amandla akho;
qinisa, Nkulunkulu,
lokho ozenzela khona.

Izikhulu ziyakuvela eGibithe;
amaKushe ayakwelulela ngokushesha
izandla zawo kuNkulunkulu.

yona ekhwela phezu kwamazulu ezulu asendulo;
bhekani, iyezwakalisa izwi layo,
izwi elinamandla.

Nikani uNkulunkulu amandla;
ubukhosi bakhe buphezu kuka-Israyeli;
amandla akhe asemafwini.

Nkulunkulu, uyesabeka ezindaweni zakho ezingcwele;
uNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli nguyena owenzela abantu amandla nokuqina;
makadunyiswe uNkulunkulu.

69:
Ngishone odakeni lobishi olujulileyo, kungekho kuma;
ngingene emanzini alutwa;
imisinga iyangicwilisa.

Abangizonda ngeze baningi kunezinwele zekhanda lami;
baningi abafuna ukungiqeda beyizitha zami kungekho sici;
nengingakuphanganga ngakubuyisela.

Ngikhiphe odakeni, mangingashoni;
mangisindiswe kubo abangizondayo,
nasemanzini alutwa.

Ngiphendule, Jehova,
ngokuba umusa wakho ulungile;
uphendukele kimi ngokobubele bakho obukhulu.

Ungayifihleli inceku yakho ubuso bakho,
ngokuba ngiyahlupheka;
shesha ungiphendule.

Wena uyakwazi ukuthukwa kwami,
namahloni ami nokudunyazwa kwami;
zonke izitha zami ziphambi kwakho.

Amehlo abo mawafiphale,
ukuze bangaboni;
izinkalo zabo zintengezele njalo.

Mina kodwa ngihluphekile, ngibuhlungu;
insindiso yakho,
Nkulunkulu mayingilondoloze.

Kuyakuthi abayizivi bekubona, bajabule;
nina enifuna uNkulunkulu,
inhliziyo yenu mayiphile.

Ngokuba uNkulunkulu uzakulisindisa iSiyoni,
akhe imizi yakwaJuda;
bazakuhlala khona, ibe yifa labo.

70:
Mabethabe, bajabule kuwe bonke abakufunayo;
abathanda insindiso yakho mabasho njalonjalo, bathi:
“Makabe mkhulu uNkulunkulu.”

Ngokuba mina ngihluphekile, ngimpofu;
Nkulunkulu, ngiphuthumele.
Wena uyinsizakalo yami nomkhululi wami;
Jehova, ungalibali.

71:
Ngencike kuwe kwasesiswini;
nguwe owangikhipha ezibilinini zikamame;
ukudumisa kwami kuyakuba ngawe njalo.

bathi: “UNkulunkulu umshiyile;
zingelani nimbambe,
ngokuba akakho osindisayo.”

Abamelene nomphefumulo wami mabajabhe, baphele;
abangifunela umonakalo mabembathe
amahloni nenhlamba.

Umlomo wami uyakulanda ukulunga kwakho,
nensindiso yakho lonke usuku;
ngokuba anginakukubala.

Ukulunga kwakho, Nkulunkulu, kufinyelele ezulwini;
wena owenze izinto ezinkulu, Nkulunkulu,
ngubani onjengawe na?

72:
Kuyakuba khona inala kakolweni ezweni
esiqongweni sezintaba;
ukudla kwalo kuyakuhashazela njengeLebanoni;
abemizi bayakukhahlela njengotshani bomhlaba.

Igama layo liyakuma kuze kube phakade;
igama layo liyakuxhanta,
lisekhona ilanga;
bayakuzibusisa ngayo;
bonke abezizwe bayakuthi ibusisiwe.

73:
ngaba yisiphukuphuku,
angaqonda lutho;
ngaba yisilwane kuwe.

Inyama yami nenhliziyo yami iyaphela;
nokho uNkulunkulu uyidwala lenhliziyo yami
nesabelo sami kuze kube phakade.

Kepha mina kungilungele ukusondela kuNkulunkulu;
ngenzile iNkosi uJehova ibe yisiphephelo sami,
ukuze ngishumayele zonke izenzo zakho.

74:
Izimpawu zethu asiziboni;
akusekho mprofethi;
akakho kithina owaziyo ukuthi koze kube nini.

Usuku ngolwakho,
nobusuku ngobakho;
nguwena owenza ukukhanya nelanga.

Vuka, Nkulunkulu,
uyimele indaba yakho;
khumbula ukuthi uklolodelwa yiziwula usuku lonke.

75:
Siyakubonga, Nkulunkulu, siyabonga;
igama lakho liseduze;
balanda izimangaliso zakho.

kepha uNkulunkulu ungumahluleli;
omunye uyamehlisa,
omunye amphakamise.

Ngokuba esandleni seNkosi kukhona isitsha;
iwayini liyakhephuza;
sigcwele ngeliqungiweyo,
yona iyathulula ngaso;
impela bonke ababi emhlabeni bayakuyimunca inhleze yalo,
bayiphuze.

76:
Bachithekile abaqinile ngenhliziyo,
balele ubuthongo babo;
amaqhawe awafumanisanga izandla zawo.

Wena, yebo, wena uyesabeka;
ngubani ongema ebusweni bakho
ngesikhathi solaka lwakho na?

77:
Osukwini losizi lwami ngiyayifuna iNkosi;
ebusuku isandla sami seluliwe, asidangali;
umphefumulo wami wala ukududuzwa.

Uzibambile izinkophe zamehlo ami, angavaleki;
ngikhathazekile,
angisakwazi ukukhuluma.

Ebusuku ngiyakhumbula ukubetha kwami ugubhu,
ngizindla enhliziyweni yami;
nomoya wami uyahlolisisa.

Izwi lokuduma kwakho lalisesivunguvungwini;
imibani yakhanyisa izwe;
umhlaba wadikizela, wazamazama.

78:
Ngalokho uJehova ekuzwa lokho
wathukuthela, kwavutha umlilo ngoJakobe,
ulaka lwavuka ngo-Israyeli;

Walungisela intukuthelo yakhe indlela;
akaphephisanga umphefumulo wabo ekufeni,
kepha wanikela ukuphila kwabo ezifweni.

Waxosha abezizwe phambi kwabo;
edabula izwe wababela ifa,
wahlalisa izizwe zakwa-Israyeli ematendeni azo.

79:
Nkulunkulu, abezizwe bangenile efeni lakho;
bangcolisile ithempeli lakho elingcwele;
benze iJerusalema libe yincithakalo.

Mawungasibaleli amacala akuqala;
umusa wakho mawusheshe usihlangabeze,
ngokuba sesibuthakathaka kakhulu.

Ukububula kwesiboshwa makuze phambi kwakho;
londoloza ngobukhulu bengalo
yakho asebengabantwana bokufa.

80:
Nkulunkulu Sebawoti, mawubuye;
bheka usezulwini, ubone,
unakekele lo mvini,

Sibuyise, Jehova Nkulunkulu Sebawoti;
ukhanyise ubuso bakho,
khona siyakusindiswa.

81:
Wakhuleka usosizini, ngakukhulula;
ngakuphendula ngisekusithekeni kokuduma,
ngakuvivinya ngasemanzini aseMeriba. Sela*

Mina nginguJehova uNkulunkulu wakho
owakukhuphula ezweni laseGibithe;
khamisa umlomo wakho, ngiwugcwalise.

82:
Abanakwazi, abanakuqonda,
bahamba ebumnyameni;
izisekelo zonke zomhlaba ziyazamazama.

84:
Umphefumulo wami ulangazelela,
womela amagceke kaJehova;
inhliziyo yami nomzimba wami kuyahuba ngokwethaba kuNkulunkulu ophilayo.

Bedabula imfunda yezinyembezi
bayenza ibe yindawo yeziphethu;
yebo, nemvula yokuqala iyayisibekela ngezibusiso.

Ngokuba uJehova uNkulunkulu uyilanga nesihlangu;
uJehova uyakupha umusa nodumo;
akayikubenqabela okuhle abahamba ngobuqotho.

85:
Mangizwe lokho uNkulunkulu uJehova azakukukhuluma;
uyakhuluma ukuthula kubantu bakhe
nakubo abamesabayo;
mabangabuyeli ebuwuleni.

86:
Ngifundise, Jehova, indlela yakho;
ngiyakuhamba eqinisweni lakho;
yenza inhliziyo yami iqonde ntonye,
yesabe igama lakho.

Nkulunkulu, izideleli zingivukele,
ibandla lezidlwangudlwangu lifuna umphefumulo wami;
azibekanga wena phambi kwazo.

87:
Kuyakuthiwa ngeSiyoni:
“Yilo nalo wazalelwa khona;
oPhezukonke uyaliqinisa.”

88:
Engikade ngazana nabo ubaxoshele kude,
wangenza ngibe yisinengiso kubo;
ngivalelwe, ngingephume.

Iso lami liyafa ngosizi;
ngikhala kuwe Jehova imihla yonke,
ngizelulela izandla zami kuwe.

Kepha mina, Jehova, ngikhala kuwe;
ekuseni umkhuleko wami uyenyuka
phambi kwakho.

89:
Ngelakho izulu, ngowakho umhlaba;
izwe nokugcwala kwalo,
kukho konke ubeke isisekelo.

Sibusisiwe isizwe esikwazi ukuhlabelela ngenjabulo;
siyahamba, Jehova,
ekukhanyeni kobuso bakho.

90:
Izinsuku zeminyaka yethu zineminyaka engamashumi ayisikhombisa;
kuthi uma ziziningi, zineminyaka engamashumi ayisishiyagalombili;
nokho ukuvama kwazo kungukuhlupheka nelize,
ngokuba zidlula masinyane,
thina siyandiza, simuke.

Yebo, ubuhle beNkosi uNkulunkulu wethu abube phezu kwethu,
umise umsebenzi wezandla zethu phezu kwethu;
yebo, umsebenzi wezandla zethu uwumise.

91:
Ngezimpaphe zakhe uyakukusibekela,
uphephele phansi kwamaphiko akhe;
ukuthembeka kwakhe kuyisihlangu nehawu.

ngokuba uthi:
Jehova, uyisiphephelo sami;
oPhezukonke umenzile abe yinqaba yakho.

Uyakungibiza, ngimphendule;
ngiyakuba naye esosizini,
ngimkhulule, ngimdumise.

92:
Ngokuba bheka, izitha zakho, Jehova,
bheka, izitha zakho, ziyakubhubha;
bonke abenza okubi bayakuhlakazwa.

93:
Imifula iphakamisile, Jehova,
imifula iphakamisile ukuholoba kwayo;
imifula iphakamisa ukuduma kwayo.

94:
Bayampompoza,
bakhuluma amagangangozi;
bayazidla bonke abenza okubi.

Uyaphindisela kubo ukushinga kwabo,
abaqede ngobubi babo;
uJehova uNkulunkulu wethu uyakubaqeda.

96:
Thanini phakathi kwabezizwe: “UJehova uyinkosi,”
izwe lihlala liqinile, lingenakushukunyiswa;
uthetha amacala ezizwe ngobuqotho.

97:
UJehova uyinkosi;
umhlaba mawethabe,
zijabule iziqhingi eziningi.

Nina enithanda uJehova zondani okubi;
uyagcina imiphefumulo yabamkhonzayo;
uyabasindisa ezandleni zababi.

98:
Mhubeleni uJehova igama elisha,
ngokuba wenze izimangaliso;
esokunene sakhe nengalo yakhe engcwele kumtholele ukunqoba.

99:
Amandla eNkosi athanda okulungileyo,
umisile ubuqotho;
ukwahlulela nokulunga ukwenzile kwaJakobe.

Mphakamiseni uJehova uNkulunkulu wethu,
nikhuleke ngasesanabelweni sezinyawo zakhe;
ungcwele yena.

100:
Yazini ukuthi uJehova unguNkulunkulu;
nguye osenzileyo, akuthina,
sibe ngabantu bakhe nezimvu zedlelo lakhe.

Ngenani emasangweni akhe ngokubonga,
nasemagcekeni akhe ngokudumisa;
mbongeni, nibusise igama lakhe.

Ngokuba muhle uJehova;
umusa wakhe umi phakade,
nokuthembeka kwakhe ezizukulwaneni ngezizukulwane.

101:
Angizukubeka phambi kwamehlo ami into embi;
ukwenza kwabahlubukayo ngiyakuzonda;
akuyikunamathela kimi.

Amehlo ami akwabathembekileyo bomhlaba
ukuba bahlale nami;
ohamba endleleni engenacala uyakungikhonza.

102:
Ungafihli ubuso bakho kimi ngosuku losizi lwami;
beka indlebe yakho kimi,
ngosuku engimemeza ngalo usheshe ungiphendule.

Uyakuvuka, uhawukele iSiyoni;
sekuyisikhathi sokuliphatha ngomusa,
yebo, isikhathi esimisiweyo sesifikile.

Ngithi: “Nkulunkulu wami,
ungangisusi enxenyeni yezinsuku zami;
iminyaka yakho isezizukulwaneni ngezizukulwane.

Kuyakubhubha lokhu,
kepha uyakuma;
yebo, kuyakuguga konke njengengubo;
njengesambatho uyakukuguqula, kuguqulwe.

104:
Mbonge uJehova, mphefumulo wami;
Jehova Nkulunkulu wami, umkhulu,
wembethe udumo nobukhosi;

obeka imishayo yezindlu zakhe emanzini,
owenza amafu abe yinqola yakhe,
ohamba ngamaphiko omoya;

Jehova, yeka ubuningi bemisebenzi yakho;
yonke uyenzile ngokuhlakanipha;
umhlaba ugcwele izidalwa zakho.

Nantu ulwandle, lukhulu, lubanzi;
lapho kukhona izilwanyana ezinwabuzelayo ezingenakubalwa,
izilwane ezincane nezinkulu.

Uyasitheza ubuso bakho, zethuke;
uyasusa umphefumulo wazo, zife,
zibuyele othulini lwazo.

106:
Obaba abaqondanga izibonakaliso zakho eGibithe,
abakhumbulanga ubuningi bezenzo zakho zomusa;
bahlubuka ngaselwandle, uLwandle Olubomvu.

Kaningi wabakhulula;
kepha bahlubuka ngecebo labo,
bawiswa phansi ngobubi babo.

107:
Bakhuphukela ezulwini,
babuye behlela kuzo izintwa;
umphefumulo wancibilika ngosizi.

Bayendayenda,
bantengezela njengodakiweyo;
konke ukuhlakanipha kwabo kwagwinywa.

108:
Inhliziyo yami iduduzekile, Nkulunkulu;
ngizakuhlabelela, ngihube,
ngisho nomphefumulo wami.

UMowabi uyisitsha sami sokuhlambela;
phezu kuka-Edomi ngiphonsa isicathulo sami;
phezu kweFilistiya ngiyethaba.”

109:
Mabathuke bona, wena ubusise;
nxa bevuka, mabajabhe;
kepha inceku yakho mayithokoze.

110:
Abantu bakho bayazinikela ngenjabulo ngosuku lwempi yakho;
ebuhleni bobungcwele abasha bakho
bavela njengamazolo esizalweni sokusa.

111:
Wabathumela abantu bakhe ukukhululwa;
uyalezile isivumelwano sakhe kuze kube phakade;
lingcwele, liyesabeka igama lakhe.

Ukumesaba uJehova kungukuqala kokuhlakanipha;
banengqondo enhle bonke abakwenzayo.
Udumo lwakhe lumi kuze kube phakade.

112:
Uyaphana, uyabanika abampofu;
ukulunga kwakhe kumi kuze kube phakade;
uphondo lwakhe luyakuphakama ngodumo.

Omubi uyakukubona, acunuke,
agedle amazinyo akhe, abesephela;
isifiso sababi siyakubhubha.

115:
Zinezandla, kepha aziphathi;
zinezinyawo, kepha azihambi;
