Uma bengiyakuyibala,
miningi kunesihlabathi;
lapho ngivuka, bengiyakuba nawe.

Ngihole, Nkulunkulu,
wazi inhliziyo yami;
ngilinge, wazi imicabango yami,

140:
Abazidlayo bangifihlela ugibe;
